**BOARD RESOLUTION – APPROVAL OF ENERGY MANAGEMENT PROGRAM BUDGET**

**Sharda Group of Companies**
Registered Office: 14, Industrial Area Phase-II, Bhiwandi, Thane District, Maharashtra 421302
CIN: U28910MH1998PLC112233

**RESOLUTION PASSED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF SHARDA GROUP OF COMPANIES**

**Date:** 15 April 2023
**Place:** Bhiwandi, Maharashtra
**Resolution Number:** BR/2023/EM-04

**Reference:** Approval of the Energy Management Program Budget, Contract with M/s GreenGrid Energy Solutions Pvt. Ltd., and Constitution of the Energy Steering Committee.

---

**WHEREAS** the Board of Directors, at its meeting held on 28 February 2023 (Resolution No. BR/2023/EM-01), had authorized the management to conduct a detailed energy audit across all manufacturing sites and corporate offices of the Company, and to invite competitive bids for the implementation of an Energy Management Program;

**WHEREAS** the energy audit, conducted by M/s EcoSustain Consultants, was submitted to the Board on 10 April 2023 and identified potential annual savings of approximately Rupees One Crore Forty-Two Lakhs (₹1,42,00,000) through a combination of LED retrofits, variable frequency drives, power factor correction, and a centralized SCADA-based monitoring system;

**WHEREAS** the management, pursuant to the tender process, received bids from three qualified vendors and, after evaluation by the Project Management Consultant, recommended the acceptance of the bid submitted by M/s GreenGrid Energy Solutions Pvt. Ltd., having its registered office at Pune, Maharashtra;

**WHEREAS** the total contract value for the Energy Management Program, as negotiated and recommended by the management, is Rupees Eighty-Seven Lakhs Fifty Thousand Only (₹87,50,000), exclusive of applicable taxes, and the same has been found to be within the budget provision approved by the Board in the Annual Operating Plan for the Financial Year 2023-24;

**WHEREAS** the Board has considered the draft Service Agreement, the payment milestone schedule, the warranty provisions, and the risk mitigation measures including the Performance Bank Guarantee and retention money, as placed before this meeting.

---

**NOW, THEREFORE, IT IS HEREBY RESOLVED THAT:**

1. The Board hereby **approves the Energy Management Program Budget** in the aggregate amount of **Rupees Eighty-Seven Lakhs Fifty Thousand Only (₹87,50,000)** , exclusive of applicable taxes, for the implementation of energy efficiency measures across all sites of the Company, as detailed in the proposal submitted by the management.

2. The Board hereby **ratifies and approves** the execution of the Service Agreement dated 10 April 2023 between the Company and **M/s GreenGrid Energy Solutions Pvt. Ltd.** for the implementation of the Energy Management Program, on the terms and conditions placed before this meeting, including but not limited to:

a. Total contract value of ₹87,50,000, exclusive of taxes;
   b. Payment linked to milestone completion, as per the schedule annexed to the Service Agreement;
   c. Retention money of 10% of the contract value to be held as per the defect liability provisions;
   d. Performance Bank Guarantee of 10% of the contract value, valid for the duration of the contract plus the warranty period;
   e. Comprehensive warranty for twenty-four (24) months from the date of final system acceptance.

3. The Board hereby **constitutes an Energy Steering Committee** to oversee the implementation of the Energy Management Program, to monitor progress against the approved milestones, to review the findings of the energy audit and subsequent re-audits, and to report to the Board on a quarterly basis.

